  `${plainTitle()}: Power BI layout`, "", `Made with the Power BI Layout Studio, https://babarda.com/tools/powerbi-layout/`, `Canvas: ${sizeOf().w} x ${sizeOf().h} px. Pages: ${allPis().length}.`, "",
  "1. Load the theme: View > Themes > Browse for themes > theme.json. Visual backgrounds turn transparent so the image shows through.",
  "2. For each page: Format page > Canvas background > Browse > the PNG. Image fit: Fit. Transparency: 0%.",
  "3. Place each visual on its slot: positions.csv lists x, y, width and height in Power BI pixels (Format > General > Properties).",
